The lepos rule for d = 2, p = 25 is rule SMR25 of M. Festa and A. Sommariva, "Computing
almost minimal formulas on the square", J. Comput. Appl. Math. 236 (2012) 4296-4302, taken
from J. Burkardt's square_minimal_rule port (MIT license) and mapped to [0,1]^2. A few ghpos
rules are closed-form rules from the literature, copied in; NOTICE.md names them.
